---
// Decorative key hints: styled keys only, no Gamepad API (spec: hints are
// decoration; keyboard reality is Arrow/Enter/Escape). Hidden from assistive
// tech (real link text carries the meaning) and by the cluster hide rules in
// global.css on short (<560px) or coarse-pointer viewports (design AD4).
// Key glyphs are oversized for legibility over the busy shell field.
---
<footer class="key-hints flex items-center gap-4 font-label text-xl uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-text-secondary" aria-hidden="true">
	<span class="flex items-center gap-2">
		<kbd class="inline-flex min-w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-[2px] border border-text-secondary/40 px-2.5 py-1.5 text-lg leading-none text-text-primary">↑↓</kbd>
		move
	</span>
	<span class="flex items-center gap-2">
		<kbd class="inline-flex min-w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-[2px] border border-text-secondary/40 px-2.5 py-1.5 text-lg leading-none text-text-primary">↵</kbd>
		select
	</span>
	<span class="flex items-center gap-2">
		<kbd class="inline-flex min-w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-[2px] border border-text-secondary/40 px-2.5 py-1.5 text-lg leading-none text-text-primary">Esc</kbd>
		back
	</span>
</footer>
